  "document": "Vamping Venus\nVamping Venus is a 1928 American comedy film directed by Edward F. Cline, written by Howard J. Green and Ralph Spence, and starring Charles Murray, Louise Fazenda, Thelma Todd, Russ Powell, Joe Bonomo and Guinn\" Big Boy\" Williams. It was released on May 13, 1928, by First National Pictures."
